        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "囲碁の対局では、星目に石を打つことで序盤の布石を築くことが多い。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "プロの棋士は、星目への着手一つにも深い戦略を秘めている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "囲碁入門書で、星目の重要性について学んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "もくせいもくせいがにほふよ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "第二海豹と雲",
                "author": "北原白秋",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "nine-stone handicap (with black stones placed on the star points)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "囲碁の初心者が上級者と対局する際は、星目の置き碁で指導を受けることがある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼との囲碁の対局では、いつも星目で打ってもらっている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "星目の置き碁は、棋力差のある対局を成立させるための伝統的な方法だ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
